    <Placemark>
      <name>An Evening at Vaucluse House</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>An Evening at Vaucluse House</b><br><i>Cultural</i><br>Thu 4th Jun<br>Vaucluse House, Wentworth Road, Vaucluse NSW 2030<br>Check site<br><br>Explore Vaucluse House after dark with an intimate tour. Discover the lavishly decorated drawing room by candlelight and hear stories about the Wentworth family and their servants. Enjoy nibbles and a glass of wine in the servants’ kitchen.<br><br><a href="https://mhnsw.au/whats-on/events/an-evening-visit-to-vaucluse-house/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#orange-dot.png</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>151.270956,-33.8563112,0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
    <Placemark>
      <name>A Love Letter to Mexico</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>A Love Letter to Mexico</b><br><i>Food &amp; Drink</i><br>Sat 6th Jun<br>THE ROCKS, FOOD &amp; DRINK<br>Check site<br><br>Celebrate bold Mexican flavors at Melba's Rooftop. Enjoy modern dishes by Chef Han Chen and Don Julio tequila cocktails by Seine Cheung. Upgrade to premium Don Julio 1942 for a luxe experience.<br><br><a href="https://whatson.cityofsydney.nsw.gov.au/?time=weekend">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#red-dot.png</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <coordinates>151.210898,-33.867331,0</coordinates>
      </Point>
    </Placemark>
