      <description><![CDATA[<b>Lucas Debargue Piano Recital</b><br><i>Music</i><br>Wed 3rd Jun – Thu 4th Jun<br>Sydney City, Sydney City<br>from $35<br><br>A rare performance by the imaginative French pianist Lucas Debargue.<br><br><a href="https://www.sydney.com/destinations/sydney/sydney-city/city-centre/events/live-the-great-lucas-debargue-lenigme-francaise">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
