    <Placemark>
      <name>Vivid Sydney 2026</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<b>Vivid Sydney 2026</b><br><i>Festival</i><br>Fri 22nd May – Sat 13th Jun<br>Bennelong Point, Sydney Harbour, Sydney Harbour<br>Free<br><br>Vivid Sydney features extraordinary lighting sculptures, cutting-edge music, and ideas programs. This annual event transforms Sydney into an outdoor gallery of light and creativity.<br><br><a href="https://www.nsw.gov.au/visiting-and-exploring-nsw/nsw-events/vivid-sydney-2026">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
