      <description><![CDATA[<b>Vivid Sydney</b><br><i>Festival</i><br>Fri 22nd May – Sat 13th Jun<br>City-wide, Sydney CBD<br>Free (Light Walk)<br><br>The world's largest light, music, and ideas festival illuminates Sydney's landmarks, including the Opera House, Harbour Bridge, and Darling Harbour, over 23 nights.<br><br><a href="https://sydneyholidays.com.au/sydney-events">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
