      <description><![CDATA[<b>Sin City: Sydney Crime Stories</b><br><i>Cultural</i><br>Sun 7th Jun<br>Justice &amp; Police Museum, Corner Albert and Phillip streets, Sydney NSW 2000<br>Check site<br><br>Discover Sydney's turbulent past with a two-hour walk through The Rocks and the waterfront, uncovering stories of crime and history.<br><br><a href="https://mhnsw.au/whats-on/events/sin-city-sydney/">More info / tickets</a>]]></description>
